Gullak 2.0.2 — Supervisor password confirmation feedback

- In Individual Supervisor account creation, the re-enter password field now shows a green tick at the end as soon as both account passwords match.
- If the confirmation field contains any characters and does not match, it shows a red cross. The indicator remains blank while the confirmation field is empty.
- The indicator updates immediately while typing in either password field.
- Account creation still requires the confirmation to match. Kid account creation also retains the required re-enter password field.
- No Family-mode changes.
